{
  "schema": 1,
  "goals": [
    "Name shops and say where you go shopping (à la, au, chez)",
    "Give quantities: une bouteille de, un kilo de",
    "Ask the price and count to 1,000",
    "Conjugate vouloir and pouvoir",
    "Manage a conversation in a shop"
  ],
  "lessons": [
    {
      "id": "fr-5.2-1",
      "title": "À la boulangerie",
      "subtitle": "Shops and chez",
      "topics": ["shopping"],
      "words": ["shopping#bakery", "shopping#butcher's", "shopping#cake shop", "shopping#grocer's", "shopping#chemist's, pharmacy", "shopping#bookshop", "shopping#stationer's", "shopping#market", "shopping#florist's", "shopping#supermarket", "shopping#shop", "shopping#baker", "shopping#butcher"],
      "learn": [
        {"title": "Shops", "blocks": [
          {"type": "table", "textCols": [0], "rows": [
            ["bakery", "la boulangerie"], ["butcher's", "la boucherie"], ["cake shop", "la pâtisserie"], ["grocer's", "l'épicerie"],
            ["chemist's", "la pharmacie"], ["bookshop", "la librairie"], ["stationer's", "la papeterie"], ["market", "le marché"],
            ["supermarket", "le supermarché"], ["shop", "le magasin"]
          ]},
          {"type": "tip", "title": "False friend", "en": "*La librairie* is a bookshop, not a library! A library is *la bibliothèque*."}
        ]},
        {"title": "à la or chez?", "blocks": [
          {"type": "text", "en": "You go to a shop with *à la / au / à l'*: *Je vais à la boulangerie. Je vais au marché.* You go to a person (the shopkeeper) with *chez*: *Je vais chez le boulanger.* (I'm going to the baker's.) *Chez* is also used for homes: *chez moi* (at my place), *chez Paul* (at Paul's)."},
          {"type": "examples", "items": [
            {"fr": "J'achète du pain à la boulangerie.", "en": "I buy bread at the bakery."},
            {"fr": "Ma mère va chez le boucher.", "en": "My mum is going to the butcher's."},
            {"fr": "On mange chez moi ?", "en": "Shall we eat at my place?"}
          ]},
          {"type": "check", "item": {"type": "cloze", "fr": "Je vais ___ boulanger.", "a": ["chez le"]}}
        ]},
        {"title": "Words", "blocks": [{"type": "vocab"}]}
      ],
      "practice": [
        {"id": "fr-5.2-1-01", "type": "cloze", "fr": "Je vais ___ boulangerie.", "a": ["à la"]},
        {"id": "fr-5.2-1-02", "type": "cloze", "fr": "Tu vas ___ marché ?", "a": ["au"]},
        {"id": "fr-5.2-1-03", "type": "cloze", "fr": "Nous allons ___ boucher.", "a": ["chez le"]},
        {"id": "fr-5.2-1-04", "type": "cloze", "fr": "Elle va ___ pharmacie.", "a": ["à la"]},
        {"id": "fr-5.2-1-05", "type": "cloze", "fr": "On va ___ supermarché.", "a": ["au"]},
        {"id": "fr-5.2-1-06", "type": "cloze", "fr": "Je vais ___ Paul.", "a": ["chez"]},
        {"id": "fr-5.2-1-07", "type": "cloze", "fr": "Ils vont ___épicerie.", "a": ["à l'"]},
        {"id": "fr-5.2-1-08", "type": "build", "en": "I'm going to the bakery.", "a": ["Je vais à la boulangerie."]},
        {"id": "fr-5.2-1-09", "type": "build", "en": "I buy a book at the bookshop.", "a": ["J'achète un livre à la librairie."]},
        {"id": "fr-5.2-1-10", "type": "build", "en": "We're going to the market.", "a": ["{Nous allons|On va} au marché."]},
        {"id": "fr-5.2-1-11", "type": "build", "en": "I'm going to Tom's.", "a": ["Je vais chez Tom."]},
        {"id": "fr-5.2-1-12", "type": "build", "en": "Where is the chemist's?", "a": ["Où est la pharmacie ?"]},
        {"id": "fr-5.2-1-13", "type": "order", "en": "My mum is going to the butcher's shop.", "a": ["Ma mère va à la boucherie", "Ma maman va à la boucherie"], "extra": ["au", "chez"]}
      ]
    },
    {
