    {
      "id": "fr-5.2-4",
      "title": "Vous désirez ?",
      "subtitle": "Vouloir, pouvoir and a conversation in a shop",
      "topics": ["vouloir-pouvoir", "shopping"],
      "words": ["verbs-irregular#to want", "verbs-irregular#to be able to, can", "verbs#to pay", "verbs#to buy", "verbs-irregular#to sell", "verbs#to desire", "shopping#what would you like?", "shopping#that's all"],
      "learn": [
        {"title": "Vouloir and pouvoir", "blocks": [
          {"type": "table", "verb": "vouloir", "tense": "present"},
          {"type": "table", "verb": "pouvoir", "tense": "present"},
          {"type": "text", "en": "Both verbs can be followed by an infinitive: *Je veux acheter du pain. Tu peux payer ?*"},
          {"type": "tip", "title": "je voudrais", "en": "In a shop *je voudrais* (I would like) is more polite than *je veux* (I want)."},
          {"type": "tip", "title": "je puis", "en": "You'll see the form *je puis* in tables, but it's only used in the formal question *Puis-je... ?* Normally say *je peux*."},
          {"type": "check", "item": {"type": "cloze", "fr": "Tu ___ venir ?", "a": ["peux"], "hint": "pouvoir"}}
        ]},
        {"title": "In the shop", "blocks": [
          {"type": "examples", "items": [
            {"fr": "Bonjour, vous désirez ?", "en": "Hello, what would you like?"},
            {"fr": "Je voudrais une baguette et deux croissants, s'il vous plaît.", "en": "I'd like a baguette and two croissants, please."},
            {"fr": "Et avec ça ?", "en": "Anything else?"},
            {"fr": "C'est tout, merci. Ça fait combien ?", "en": "That's all, thank you. How much is that?"},
            {"fr": "Trois euros quarante.", "en": "Three euros forty."},
            {"fr": "Je peux payer par carte ?", "en": "Can I pay by card?"}
          ]},
          {"type": "text", "en": "*Payer* (to pay) can be conjugated in two ways: *je paie* and *je paye*. Both are correct."}
        ]},
        {"title": "Words", "blocks": [{"type": "vocab"}]}
      ],
      "practice": [
        {"id": "fr-5.2-4-f", "type": "form", "verb": "vouloir", "tense": "present"},
        {"id": "fr-5.2-4-01", "type": "cloze", "fr": "Je ___ un croissant.", "a": ["veux"], "hint": "vouloir"},
